      "content": "i know, i should probably ask my doctor but they are so hard to get an appointment with and i dont want to wait weeks to feel better. i just want to know if there is like a specific reason why it wouldn't work? does it just make it less effective or something? i just want to make sure i'm not doing anything crazy.",
